<title>JAPAN: Ricoh hits year high then loses momentum.</title>
<headline>Ricoh hits year high then loses momentum.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Ricoh Co Ltd briefly surpassed the high for the year in early Monday morning trade, as investors moved to buy back global issues that were sold off on Friday, brokers said.</p>
<p>Its shares were 30 yen higher at 1,320 as of 0039 GMT, off from the high of 1,350 yen reached soon after the market opened.</p>
<p>It was the most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo bourse in a volume of 2.729 million shares.</p>
